## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: OverlapSettingsGuard
## Notes: Keeps settings that overlap another installed add-on switched off, and explains why when one is switched on. Type /osg.
## Author: Rex Sun
## Version: 0.8.0
## OptionalDeps: GearInsight_Forever, YUI, EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIUnitFrames, EllesmereUIRaidFrames, EllesmereUINameplates, Skinner, Details

Core.lua
Policy.lua
Adapters/GearInsight.lua
Adapters/YUI.lua
Adapters/EllesmereUI.lua
Adapters/Skinner.lua
Guard.lua
